{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":45.13999938964844,"text":"Hagia Sophia in Thessaloniki is about 1,200 years old, and it keeps a secret in its dome. What you see up there now is a mosaic of Christ with angels and apostles on a gold ground. Underneath it, in patches that are still visible, there is an older mosaic, a plain cross with no face anywhere on it. The reason is a real argument that lasted more than a century. For a time, the empire banned pictures of people in churches. Anyone who painted a face was in danger, and a great deal of work was destroyed. When the ban ended, craftsmen covered the cross with a new mosaic, but did not scrape it away. So the dome holds both decisions, one over the other, like a page rewritten without rubbing out what was there before.","words":[{"word":"Hagia","start":0,"end":0.8199999928474426},{"word":"Sophia","start":0.8199999928474426,"end":1.2200000286102295},{"word":"in","start":1.2200000286102295,"end":1.6399999856948853},{"word":"Thessaloniki","start":1.6399999856948853,"end":2.180000066757202},{"word":"is","start":2.180000066757202,"end":2.680000066757202},{"word":"about","start":2.680000066757202,"end":3.0199999809265137},{"word":"1","start":3.0199999809265137,"end":3.619999885559082},{"word":"200","start":3.619999885559082,"end":3.619999885559082},{"word":"years","start":3.619999885559082,"end":4.139999866485596},{"word":"old","start":4.139999866485596,"end":4.380000114440918},{"word":"and","start":4.559999942779541,"end":4.860000133514404},{"word":"it","start":4.860000133514404,"end":5.260000228881836},{"word":"keeps","start":5.260000228881836,"end":5.260000228881836},{"word":"a","start":5.260000228881836,"end":5.820000171661377},{"word":"secret","start":5.820000171661377,"end":5.820000171661377},{"word":"in","start":5.820000171661377,"end":6.059999942779541},{"word":"its","start":6.059999942779541,"end":6.320000171661377},{"word":"dome","start":6.320000171661377,"end":6.519999980926514},{"word":"What